				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				717,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Cocoon): Add missing VS Code API enums and terminal events\n\nExtensions like vscodevim and gitlens crash at activation when trying to access TextEditorCursorStyle (.Line, .Block, etc.) and UIKind (.Desktop, .Web) off undefined. These enums are declared in upstream editor options and extension host protocol files, but extHostTypes.js doesn't re-export them.\n\nInline the literal enum values so the API surface matches what extensions expect. Also add stub terminal shell-integration event handlers (onDidChangeTerminalShellIntegration, onDidStartTerminalShellExecution, onDidEndTerminalShellExecution) - Land doesn't track shell integration, but extensions like openai.chatgpt subscribe to these events and need them to register/dispose cleanly.\n\nKeep enums in sync with upstream VS Code definitions.",
			"SHA": "4c4b68706c090a6ac81f4c106bdc7a8aeb4b83b1"
		},
